Path 1: START | START --> CONDITION | if-else head --> STATEMENT | (node == NULL) --> MERGE | if-else merge --> CONDITION | if-else head --> STATEMENT | (key < node->key) --> STATEMENT | node->left = insert(node->left, key); --> MERGE | if-else merge --> RETURN | return node;

IMPORTANT: Choose inputs that satisfy this path's conditions.

